OL,3,AZelensky says Crimean Bridge strikes
OL,4,A'fair response' as he meets UK's
OL,5,AStreeting
OL,6,
OL,7,FUkrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky
OL,8,Fhas justified Kyiv's repeated attacks
OL,9,Fon a critical bridge linking Russia to
OL,10,Foccupied Crimea, calling it a "fair
OL,11,Fresponse" to 109 separate Russian
OL,12,Fattacks on bridges in Ukraine.
OL,14,FIn comments to the BBC in Kyiv,
OL,15,FZelensky said the intense attacks on
OL,16,FUkraine by Russia that have followed
OL,17,Fthe strikes on the Crimean Bridge were
OL,18,Fonly a "signal that Vladimir Putin does
OL,19,Fnot want to stop. He wants a reason to
OL,20,Fescalate".
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
