CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1795330533
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AZelensky says Crimean Bridge strikes
OL,4,A'fair response' as he meets UK's
OL,5,AStreeting
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe rejected the claim by the Russian
OL,8,Fpresident that the bridge - which links
OL,9,FRussia to the peninsula it illegally
OL,10,Fannexed from Ukraine - was "exclusively
OL,11,Fcivilian" in use.
OL,13,F"There are facts, not just the words of
OL,14,FPutin. We can see," he said.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/38
